{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：08:33 2026-11-13 HKT<br/>發佈時間：08:33 2026-11-13 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：08:33 2026-11-13 HKT</p><img alt=\"Microsoft大「死機」，Copilot、Outlook及Teams癱瘓  上班族工作或受影響。路透社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4f220a75d2da1e03c752dc3eaeaeb0c8/2026-11/hggflphl_.jpg\"/><p>微軟（Microsoft）旗下雲端辦公服務Microsoft 365 於13日凌晨出現全球大規模「死機」，Copilot AI功能，電郵服務 Exchange Online（Outlook）及通訊軟件 Teams受影響。微軟緊急重啟伺服器並逐步恢復服務，但截至清晨仍有數以萬計故障回報，香港的企業及上班族今早或影響電郵收發與線上會議。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T00:53:09.071146+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":250,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T00:33:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T00:46:39.102779+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T00:46:39.102779+00:00","content_hash":"33b2e7e9a1e6345297f0c10bb8217e405ca38137e821ff3e2e797e424e6e13c2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}